1
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,576
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:12,723
=Episode 11=

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:15,603
(Concubine Rou seduces
the eldest prince.)

4
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,440
Your Highness.

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,200
Rise.

6
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,640
Is everything going as planned?

7
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,560
The bait has been set.

8
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,440
Now we wait for the fish to bite.

9
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:32,920
I tore out

10
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,640
the most crucial part of the manual.

11
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,640
The eldest prince is obsessed with Go.

12
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,720
If he can't solve it,

13
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,680
he'll surely come to me.

14
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,480
Tomorrow at dusk,

15
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:43,920
His Majesty will visit the bamboo garden
with Concubine Jing.

16
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:46,040
Such a perfect chance.

17
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,880
Don't let it slip away.

18
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,080
Then I'll wait in the bamboo garden
tomorrow.

19
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:53,640
When the eldest prince comes to
ask about Go,

20
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,440
I'll make his heart race,

21
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:56,920
and lose control.

22
00:00:57,520 --> 00:01:00,000
Just wait and enjoy the show.

23
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,000
Good.

24
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:02,920
Concubine Rou.

25
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:04,320
I do admire

26
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:06,560
your ruthless decisiveness.

27
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,000
Rest assured, Your Highness.

28
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:11,800
I won't let you down.

29
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:13,440
I'll take my leave.

30
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:23,680
Your end is near, fool girl.

31
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,200
Not bad.

32
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,600
It seems

33
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,560
the Grand Tutor was right.

34
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,040
(A gentle noble, a model for all.)
You've been studying hard.

35
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,160
Thank you, Father.

36
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:37,120
With your daily guidance and

37
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,000
earnest hopes,

38
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:39,400
I dare not slack off.

39
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:40,800
Your Majesty.

40
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,560
Noble Consort Hui requests an audience.

41
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:43,520
Let her in.

42
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:47,320
Greetings, Noble Consort Hui.

43
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,120
Your Majesty.

44
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,200
Rise.

45
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:00,080
I heard you've been working hard
on state affairs.

46
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:03,560
I made you some ginseng soup
to restore your strength.

47
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,520
How thoughtful of you.

48
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,640
Father.

49
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,520
I should go back and study.

50
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:09,520
I'll take my leave.

51
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,480
Go ahead.

52
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,760
You toil day and night for the realm.

53
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,160
Please take care of your health.

54
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:19,560
The eldest prince is truly gifted.

55
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,240
He excels in his studies,

56
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,800
and spends his free time studying Go.

57
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,320
He's loved Go since childhood.

58
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,080
His skill at Go now

59
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:30,120
has even surpassed mine.

60
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,160
Indeed.

61
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,280
Lately, the eldest prince

62
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,000
has been playing Go with Concubine Rou.

63
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,120
They're always together.

64
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,920
Everyone in the palace
is talking about it.

65
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:47,520
Your Majesty.

66
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,720
Prince Su is waiting outside.

67
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,880
Show him in.

68
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,680
Yes.

69
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:57,120
Greetings, Brother.

70
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,760
Greetings, Noble Consort Hui.

71
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,760
Rise.

72
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,000
Noble Consort Hui.

73
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,360
You may leave now.

74
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,920
I have state matters to
discuss with Prince Su.

75
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,120
I'll take my leave.

76
00:03:37,261 --> 00:03:38,976
(Yaoqin)

77
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,880
Cairen Rong.

78
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:40,640
How dare you!

79
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,800
Stand before Her Highness

80
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,640
without bowing?

81
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,480
Your Highness.

82
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,520
I once offended you.

83
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,360
Please show your magnanimity,

84
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:51,840
and spare my miserable life.

85
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,000
Yaoqin.

86
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,920
You helped Zhaoyi Shen do evil.

87
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,000
You may have escaped death,

88
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,360
and your life may be spared,

89
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,640
but you can't escape punishment.

90
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:02,400
The work at Sin Jeku
is endless and grim.

91
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:05,160
You must have had a taste of it.

92
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,520
I have a chance

93
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,560
to get you out of Sin Jeku.

94
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,120
Would you take it?

95
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,440
Really?

96
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,320
Your Highness.

97
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,280
I know I was wrong.

98
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,920
Please save me!

99
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,360
If you can get me out of here,

100
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,080
I'll do anything for you.

101
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,160
I'll serve you

102
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,320
and obey your every command.

103
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,720
Your Highness.

104
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:30,840
Where's Mother?

105
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,000
Your Highness.

106
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,520
Her Highness has gone to
Mount Wanshou with the Empress Dowager.

107
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,400
She left a message for you.

108
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,640
She'll be back very late.

109
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,960
Please don't play too much

110
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:39,920
and study on time.

111
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,200
All right.

112
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,240
I understand.

113
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,200
Carry on with your duties.

114
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,080
Yes.

115
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,360
Kanghai.

116
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,800
Play Go with me.

117
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:52,400
Yes.

118
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,000
Your Highness.

119
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,040
Your Highness.

120
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,200
Please rest a while.

121
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,240
Have some bird's nest soup
to warm you up.

122
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,600
In a moment.

123
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,560
These moves are ingenious.

124
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:27,160
But just as it reaches
the crucial point,

125
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,680
the record ends abruptly.

126
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:31,920
No.

127
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,520
Rather than sit here puzzling over it,

128
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,800
I'll go ask Concubine Rou myself.

129
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:39,920
I'll be right back.

130
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:40,840
Don't follow.

131
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,080
Yes.

132
00:05:43,126 --> 00:05:49,244
(Yongshou Palace)

133
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,640
Jinxiu.

134
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,800
Is Concubine Rou in her palace?

135
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,880
(Jinxiu, Senior Palace Maid)
Your Highness.

136
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:00,720
She's not here.

137
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,480
After dinner, she said she was going to
take a walk in the bamboo garden.

138
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,680
It's cold tonight,

139
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,920
so I'm bringing her some clothes.

140
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,080
Perfect.

141
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,160
Take me to her.

142
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,120
Yes.

143
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,040
Concubine Rou.

144
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,320
Sorry to disturb you

145
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,280
so late at night.

146
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,520
Concubine Rou.

147
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,680
One page about

148
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:30,120
the Four Elders of Shangshan is missing.

149
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,640
I've worked on it so long,

150
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,000
but still can't solve it.

151
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,320
I couldn't wait until tomorrow.

152
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,160
Concubine Rou.

153
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:37,560
Please explain it to me.

154
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,880
Oh, you...

155
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,600
Keep this up,

156
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,160
and you'll become a Go fanatic.

157
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,800
Consort Qi will be cross with you.

158
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:45,560
Concubine Rou.

159
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:47,680
I can't make sense of it.

160
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,880
It's keeping me up at night.

161
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:52,680
Please tell me, Concubine Rou.

162
00:06:59,240 --> 00:06:59,840
Sit.

163
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,360
I'll explain it to you.

164
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:06,000
When I got this manual,
the page was already gone.

165
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:08,760
It must have been lost
when it was copied.

166
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,280
But I've studied it for a long time.

167
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,000
And finally,

168
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,120
I've discovered its secret.

169
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,600
Please show me, Concubine Rou.

170
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,000
Look.

171
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,920
This move here...

172
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,680
If you place it here...

173
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,040
Oh, you can play it this way too.

174
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:30,520
Then this move should go here.

175
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,400
Look.

176
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,920
You made the wrong move here.

177
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,520
It should...

178
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,680
Go here.

179
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:50,520
I wonder how things are going

180
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:51,760
in the Imperial Garden.

181
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,120
Your plan is flawless.

182
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:54,520
And Concubine Rou

183
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,960
is bold enough to go through with it.

184
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,600
It should go off perfectly.

185
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,800
Your Highness.

186
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,560
Just wait for the good news.

187
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,760
Tonight, the harem

188
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:05,160
will be full of spectacles.

189
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,280
I'll give your advice

190
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,520
careful consideration.

191
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,120
You've worked hard, too,

192
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,480
for talking so long with me.

193
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,960
It's my duty

194
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,320
to share your burdens.

195
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,560
It's no trouble at all.

196
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,240
Whenever you need me,

197
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,640
just summon me.

198
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,400
Your Majesty, Your Highness.

199
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:30,200
Jinxiu.

200
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,800
Why are you in such a rush?

201
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:32,840
Where are you going?

202
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,720
I...

203
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:34,480
I...

204
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:35,760
Why are you stammering?

205
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,920
Shouldn't you be attending
to Concubine Rou?

206
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,200
Where's Concubine Rou?

207
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,440
Your Highness.

208
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:42,240
Concubine Rou is in the pavilion.

209
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,080
I'm fetching a Go board for her.

210
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,400
At this late hour?

211
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,240
Who is she playing with?

212
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,440
Answer His Majesty at once!

213
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:51,400
Your Majesty.

214
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:52,320
It's the eldest prince.

215
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:58,520
Brother.

216
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,360
I'll take my leave.

217
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,520
Your Highness.

218
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,280
The eldest prince and Concubine Rou

219
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,720
are discussing Go at the pavilion.

220
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,000
I just told

221
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,960
His Majesty and Concubine Jing

222
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,880
that they were together.

223
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:30,680
Perfect.

224
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,680
Concubine Jing loves a good spectacle.

225
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:36,000
She'll surely lead His Majesty
to the pavilion,

226
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:38,480
where he'll catch the eldest prince

227
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,400
harassing Concubine Rou.

228
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,240
The father-son falling out

229
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:44,360
is about to begin.

230
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,640
Qingzi.

231
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,880
Go.

232
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,640
See for me

233
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,440
whether Concubine Rou's little act

234
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,120
is as spectacular as we expect.

235
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,640
Yes, Your Highness.

236
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,960
I've plotted for so long.

237
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:05,840
And now I can finally
strip him of his title

238
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:09,240
and let my son take his place.

239
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,560
Mother...

240
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,320
I want my mother!

241
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,080
Princess Jinxuan, stop crying.

242
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,280
You'll be punished again.

243
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,440
Take Princess Jinxuan away.

244
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:27,840
Make her stop crying.

245
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,720
She's ruining my mood.

246
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,240
Yes.

247
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,760
I've heard that

248
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,600
one of the endgames
in the Thirteen Chapters of Go

249
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,800
uses a similar strategy.

250
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,640
Perhaps...

251
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,480
I could dictate it to you.

252
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:49,280
Thank you.

253
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,280
The book says,

254
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,560
Black moves first.

255
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,560
Who's there?

256
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:36,200
In my Imperial Garden,

257
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,120
such a vile act is taking place?

258
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:39,680
Your Majesty.

259
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,920
That man looks

260
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,640
like the eldest prince.

261
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,200
Your Majesty.

262
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:49,440
Isn't that woman

263
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,080
Concubine Rou?

264
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:52,560
Why are they...

265
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,480
Why are they embracing?

266
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:55,640
How dare you!

267
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,960
You vile, treasonous beast!

268
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:09,960
Father!

269
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:19,360
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

270
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:24,400
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

271
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:29,200
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

272
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:34,040
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

273
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:38,800
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

274
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:43,840
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

275
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:48,640
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

276
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:53,600
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

277
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:58,360
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

278
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:01,920
♪Let the stars and sea♪

279
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,240
(Changsheng Gate)

280
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:07,120
♪Wait for your return♪
